2,1,,status,Benjamin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Minato,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The current split ignores reality. We need data to ensure winter comfort isn't a luxury.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m worried about the time spent calculating. Who actually wants to do the math every month?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. Rumors of unfairness are worse than the bills. We need objective proof of usage.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I need to see the full year’s history. I can’t commit to a new system without knowing the baseline.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want us to feel safe talking about money again. It feels heavy lately.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Victoria, the last twelve statements will show the seasonal spikes. That’s our starting point.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Benjamin, if we look at the plug-in monitors, we can see who uses what.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Mio, monitors are good, but I want to see the actual payment logs to verify consistency.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I’ll check the statements and the payment log. I need to see where the money actually went.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,I will look at the kitchen notice and the winter habits. I want to understand the context.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Minato, the winter habits might explain why we froze last year. It’s a valid concern.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,I’m going to check the reconciliation template. I want to see if it saves time or just adds steps.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll look at the plug-in monitors and the payment log. I need to correlate usage with cost.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I’m concerned about upfront costs. I’ll check the electrician’s quote to see if any changes are needed.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,I hope we can find a way that doesn’t make anyone feel guilty for using heat.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Let’s gather the facts first. Then we can decide what feels fair and sustainable.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mio,,Agreed. I really hope the template works. I don’t want to be the unpaid accountant.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I will remain quiet and observe. The data will speak for itself, and that is best.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"I will analyze the variance. If the swings are too high, we need a buffer or a different model.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minato,,Thank you. I will try to keep the mood light while we look at the numbers.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
